        "description": "List lifecycles. To list all the lifecycles send a `GET` request to [https://api.custify.com/lifecycle](https://api.custify.com/lifecycle).\nTo get a specific lifecycle send a `GET` request to [https://api.custify.com/lifecycle/:id](https://api.custify.com/lifecycle/:id).\n\n### Filtering lifecycles\nYou can apply filters using the `filters` query parameter as an URL-encoded array of objects.\n\n### Sorting\nBy default, lifecycles are sorted by `position` in ascending order. You can customize sorting using the `sort` and `order` parameters.\n",
