          }
        ]
      },
      "post": {
        "description": "You can create a new tag or update an existing one by sending a POST request to [https://api.custify.com/tag/{id}](https://api.custify.com/tag/{id}), where {id} is the value of the Custify internal `id` of the tag.\n",
