        },
        "summary": "Update an existing task",
        "tags": [
          "Tasks"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/ticket": {
      "get": {
        "description": "You can fetch a list of all tickets across all companies and people. The list, by default, is sorted by the `openedAt` field and in `descending` order, with the most recent tickets first.\n\n### Filtering tickets\nIf you want to apply filters to the `/ticket` endpoint, you would need to send the `filters` query parameter as an URL-encoded array of objects. The filtering logic is similar to other entities:\n```json\n[\n    {\n        \"field\": \"ticketStatus\",\n        \"values\": [\"open\", \"pending\"]\n    },\n    {\n        \"field\": \"priority\",\n        \"values\": [\"high\"]\n    }\n]\n```\nThe logic applied to filtering is `OR` between different values for the same field and `AND` between different fields, for example:\n```\n(ticketStatus='open' OR ticketStatus='pending') AND (priority='high')\n```\n\n### Available filter fields\n- `ticketStatus` - filters tickets by their status\n- `priority` - filters tickets by priority level\n- `assignedToName` - filters tickets by assigned user name\n- `provider` - filters tickets by provider/source system\n- `tags` - filters tickets by tag IDs (array of tag IDs)\n- `csm` - filters tickets by CSM email addresses\n- `segments` - filters tickets by company segments (Custify internal segment IDs)\n\n### Search\nYou can search tickets using the `searchTerm` query parameter. The search will look through ticket title, description, and other text fields.\n",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/itemsPerPageMax200"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/pageParam"
          },
          {
            "description": "Field to sort by",
            "in": "query",
            "name": "sort",
            "schema": {
              "default": "openedAt",
              "example": "openedAt",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "description": "Sort order (asc or desc)",
            "in": "query",
            "name": "order",
            "schema": {
              "default": "desc",
              "enum": [
                "asc",
                "desc"
              ],
              "example": "desc",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "description": "The resource items filters",
            "in": "query",
            "name": "filters",
            "schema": {
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ListingTicketFilter"
              },
              "type": "array"
            }
          },
          {
            "description": "Search term to filter tickets",
            "in": "query",
            "name": "searchTerm",
            "schema": {
              "example": "login issue",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "description": "Filter tickets by their external ID (e.g. the ticket ID from your helpdesk system like Zendesk, Freshdesk, etc.)",
            "in": "query",
            "name": "externalId",
            "schema": {
              "example": "TICKET-123",
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "properties": {
                    "tickets": {
                      "description": "Array of ticket objects",
                      "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TicketListing"
                      },
                      "type": "array"
                    },
                    "total": {
                      "description": "Total number of tickets matching the query",
                      "example": 150,
                      "type": "integer"
                    }
                  },
                  "type": "object"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful operation"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/AccessForbidden"
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Some other error occurred"
          }
        },
        "summary": "List all tickets",
        "tags": [
          "Tickets"
        ],
        "x-code-samples": [
          {
            "lang": "Curl",
            "source": "curl 'https://api.custify.com/ticket?itemsPerPage=20&page=1&sort=openedAt&order=desc' \\\n -X GET \\\n -H 'Authorization: Bearer <Your access token>' \\\n -H 'Accept: application/json' \\\n -H 'Content-Type: application/json'"
          }
        ]
      },
      "post": {
        "description": "Create a new ticket on Companies or People.\n",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Ticket"
              }
            }
          },
          "description": "Ticket request object",
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful operation"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/AccessForbidden"
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Some other error occurred"
          }
        },
        "summary": "Create a new ticket",
        "tags": [
          "Tickets"
        ]
      }
    },
