    {
      "description": "Upload files, link files to a task or note, unlink files and list files for an entity (company or people). If you want to link an uploaded file to a task or to a note please use the field `files` (providing a list of file ids) available in the create/update methods for each of the operations.\n",
      "name": "Files",
